<section class="section section--flush-top" id="story">
  <div class="wrap split">
    {% include "partials/frame.liquid", img: "/assets/img/web/lake-pair-1000.jpg", ratio: "bike", alt: "Two riders on a lakeside road in the Engadin" %}
    <div>
      <h2 class="h2">Two friends.<br>One question.</h2>
      <div class="prose mt-4">
        <p>We grew up in the Swiss Alps and found cycling together when road riding was a niche and gravel bikes did not exist as a category. We raced locally, climbed passes, travelled by bike and built our own frames in steel, aluminium and later carbon.</p>
        <p>One of us studied materials science and wanted to know how a bike works. The other studied architecture and wanted to know why a product feels right. SENDA is where those two questions meet.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="linkline mt-4" href="/story.html">Read the full story</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="engineering">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div><h2 class="h2">Carbon where<br>it does work.</h2></div>
      <p class="lead">Efficient power transfer, precise handling, balance over long distances. Material is laid where it carries load and left out where it doesn't.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="dims" style="--dims: 3">
      <div class="dim"><span class="dim__value">&lt; 7 kg</span><span class="dim__label">Target weight, SENDA Road top build</span></div>
      <div class="dim"><span class="dim__value">1207 g</span><span class="dim__label">ORMA Momentum 45 wheelset</span></div>
      <div class="dim"><span class="dim__value">2026</span><span class="dim__label">Test bikes on the road since</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap principles">
    <div>
      <h2 class="h2">Nothing added<br>for show.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="principles__list">
      <li class="principle"><span class="micro principle__n">01</span><div><h3 class="h3">Purpose before excess</h3><p>We strip back decisions until what remains is useful, considered and coherent.</p></div></li>
      <li class="principle"><span class="micro principle__n">02</span><div><h3 class="h3">Performance you can feel</h3><p>Geometry, materials and components are evaluated as one system, not a list of specifications.</p></div></li>
      <li class="principle"><span class="micro principle__n">03</span><div><h3 class="h3">Quiet by design</h3><p>Clear forms and restrained graphics leave room for the ride, the landscape and the rider.</p></div></li>
      <li class="principle"><span class="micro principle__n">04</span><div><h3 class="h3">Direct to rider</h3><p>We sell directly and put the difference into development, materials and quality.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

